    "When you place your hand over it, the energy it radiates feels abyssal."


# game/rutas/pantallas.rpy:707
translate ingles vacio_addb8ce8:

    # "Te llama a meter tu mano dentro, te susurra palabras que sin aun reconocer el idioma, entiendes a la perfección lo que te dicen..."
    "It calls you to put your hand inside, whispering words that, even without recognizing the language, you understand perfectly what they say..."

# game/rutas/pantallas.rpy:708
